From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:46:40 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: Add Tensor G4 PERIC0 sysreg

Describe the Tensor G4 PERIC0 system-register window used by USI mode
selection, with the existing syscon fallback and required interface
clock. The pinned GPL board maps this window at 0x10821000 with size
0x1000, and USI6 uses offset 0x14. These are the same addresses used by
the prototype.

No additional window, register operation or board enablement is added.
Keep the separate HSI2 identity and existing controller layouts
independent of this binding change.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zumapro/+/8831630eee2ad095b85ed452944e6353940966a5/dts/zumapro-usi.dtsi
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml  | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
index 32ac75ff5..43602bfbd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ properties:
               - google,gs201-peric1-sysreg
               - google,gs201-vgpio2ap-sysreg
               - google,zuma-ufs-sysreg
+              - google,zumapro-peric0-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos2200-cmgp-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos2200-peric0-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos2200-peric1-sysreg
@@ -110,6 +111,7 @@ allOf:
               - google,gs201-hsi2-sysreg
               - google,gs201-peric0-sysreg
               - google,gs201-peric1-sysreg
+              - google,zumapro-peric0-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos850-cmgp-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos850-peri-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos850-sysreg
